        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Curse of the Saumen Kar"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(cold, conjuration, primal)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nAinamuuren activates the runes covering his body to create an icy prison around a Huge or smaller creature he can see within 60 feet. The prison is a sphere made of unmelting ice, just large enough to fit his target. The target, and any creatures sharing its space, must attempt a 34 Reflex save. A creature that fails becomes trapped inside the prison. If it succeeds, the creature is pushed outside the prison into a space of its choice. If the target shares its space with a gargantuan creature, the effect fails.\n\nThe dome has AC 10, Hardness 20, and 40 Hit Points; and is immune to cold, critical hits, and precision damage. The prison lasts until destroyed, until Ainamuuren uses this ability to create a new prison, or until he dies."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "543cf34f-5b4c-46ff-9534-6a3ebcd1c39e",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:04.470425"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
